        "ggh9jXOIOA7_text": "<p><strong>Ryan, 34, Boston </strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "ggigxhZrsVDUE_text": "<p>FusiForce delivers a verified 5,000mg clinical dose of creatine monohydrate + standardized Panax Ginseng — tested by ISO 17025 labs after manufacturing, not before. Lab reports published for every batch.</p>",
        "ggodFIsyriS_text": "<p><strong>Derek, 51, Tampa </strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "ggpx5HRfoYE_text": "<p>\"I hit a plateau after 12 years training. These gummies broke it hard. I’m adding weight every week and my workouts feel strong again. My gym buddy is pissed because I’m progressing faster than him. I just tell him to get on the gummies.\"</p>",
        "ggtcoNr7Ykx_text": "<p>\"At 51 I thought creatine was for kids. These gummies proved me wrong. I’m moving weights I haven’t touched in years and recovering faster. My doctor asked what I’m doing different. I told him 'magic green apple candy'. He wrote it down.\"</p>",
        "ggu8JrdFw2K_childItem_0": "<p>Delivers essential daily nutrients</p>",
