    "gp_section_611048101506974307": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "2f36533c1445f519e808c78bc158df67cd9a3e25795356be0cedb7b83c9bf124_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg-1Op3gqPs_text": "<p>I trusted influencers. Bought what they promoted. Defended it to my gym friends. \"You don't understand bioavailability!\" Then the testing came out. <strong>ZERO creatine.</strong> I wasn't a non-responder. I was a scam victim. FusiForce shows their lab reports. My deadlift is up 25lbs. My trust in influencers is gone forever.</p>",
        "gg-9PVO6MgP_text": "<p><strong>— Jessica M., 31, Portland OR ✓</strong></p>",
        "gg0oNGHcHUc_childItem_0": "<p>90-Day Money Back Guarantee</p>",
        "gg1v830qDMI_text": "<p>This man said — I quote — \"bro you've been eating Haribo with extra steps.\" Then he SCREENSHOT it and sent it to our GROUP CHAT</p>",
        "gg4Hen9eRVG_text": "<p>We were supposed to discuss \"Lessons in Chemistry.\" Instead I gave a PowerPoint on creatine. Six weeks later, 7 members take FusiForce. We have a group chat called \"Creatine Queens.\" <strong>Karen hit 135lbs on squat. KAREN IS 54. WE CRIED.</strong></p>",
        "gg8OLqeBf8z_childItem_0": "<p>24/7 Customer Service</p>",
        "gg9V2q-xKoB_text": "<p><strong>— Derek M., 29, Chicago IL ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggBlzCsV-RI_text": "<p><strong>14 months of expensive candy</strong></p>",
        "ggDTcutTl8x_text": "<p><strong>I have beef with Gary and FusiForce is my weapon</strong></p>",
        "ggEHYeKzWb__text": "<p><strong>Switched from Amazon fakes. I paid $55 for literal candy</strong></p>",
        "ggGs2rnkxb-_label": "<p>TRY FUSIFORCE TODAY!</p>",
        "ggJC-50Ufum_text": "<p>Arrae \"Tone.\" Lemme \"Tone.\" All these brands marketing \"women's creatine\" with skinny models in leotards. I bought them. <strong>They contained basically NOTHING.</strong> Pink label, zero creatine. FusiForce posts their lab reports — I can literally verify what I'm paying for. My glutes finally have REAL fuel.</p>",
        "ggNCRMjQw72_text": "<p>Gary does curls in the squat rack. I looked him dead in his eyes and said \"nothing really, just genetics I guess.\" GARY LOOKED SO DEFEATED.</p>",
        "ggOZ-xDSpRb_childItem_0": "<p>FREE Shipping For Orders Above $70</p>",
        "ggRFe8a_pHT_text": "<p><strong>—</strong> Chris P., 33, Boston MA <strong>✓</strong></p>",
        "ggSXBqGjOH7_text": "<p><strong>I converted my entire book club</strong></p>",
        "ggVpyp3-Wri_text": "<p>4.8/5 from 12,847 verified reviews</p>",
        "ggWW2BKE97B_childItem_0": "<p>Over 137,235+ Happy Customers</p>",
        "ggYjpFPIsN9_text": "<p>Okay so I'm the idiot who spent $847 on PUSH gummies over 14 months. BIOAVAILABILITY OF WHAT?? CORN SYRUP??? Anyway I've been taking FusiForce for 6 weeks and my bench is up 15lbs.</p>",
        "ggZurb0fuXf_text": "<p><strong>— Emma L., 29, Seattle WA ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggeO17nhCDE_text": "<p>KAREN DOESN'T EVEN WORK OUT. It's been 6 weeks. I have converted 11 coworkers to FusiForce. We have a Slack channel called #gummygang. IT flagged it.</p>",
        "ggfAz2NaloS_text": "<p><strong>— Michelle T., 42, Denver CO ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggfImZxIcDB_text": "<strong>Real Results from </strong><span style=\"color:rgb(189,229,33);\"><i><strong>Real People</strong></i></span>",
        "ggkp1oqI2U5_text": "<p><strong>— Jake R., 34, Austin TX &nbsp;✓&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "gglMnwv0acD_text": "<p><strong>— Tyler B., 28, San Francisco CA ✓</strong></p>",
        "gglggYAIrvp_text": "<p><strong>I'm 5'2\" and was terrified of 'bulking up'</strong></p>",
        "ggoGCxa31TE_text": "<p><strong>My trainer roasted me so hard I switched careers. Jk but almost.</strong></p>",
        "ggsP6wyAH-y_text": "<p><strong>I accidentally started a cult at my office</strong></p>",
        "ggwlDt8aKAO_text": "<p><strong>I did the math and now I'm actually mad.&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "ggxLV0QDwX8_text": "<p>Avoided creatine for YEARS because influencers made it sound like one gummy = instant She-Hulk. Spoiler: that's not how anything works. Three months on FusiForce: same 5'2\". Not bulky. But I can carry ALL my groceries in one trip now. <strong>Like a CHAMPION.</strong></p>",
        "ggyVqwWVgvS_text": "<p><strong>— Brittany N., 26, San Diego CA ✓</strong></p>"
      },
